    Mathematical insight: For rotatable numbers of length n in base b to exist:
    - n+1 must be prime (p)
    - b must have multiplicative order exactly n mod p
    - This means b^n ≡ 1 (mod p) AND b^(n/q) ≠ 1 (mod p) for all prime factors q of n
    """
    if not input_str.strip():
